      "headline": "Software Engineering || Distributed Computing || Web Security",
      "about": "Hi, I'm Rahul Jha, a software engineer with 9 years of experience in building scalable and secure distributed systems. Currently working at Medtronic India, I'm a distributed systems enthusiast and passionate about building highly scalable products while keeping security as the top priority.\n\nWith extensive experience in TypeScript, PHP and Java, I love working on challenging projects that require implementing complex algorithms and data structures. I have a good understanding of database technologies, including RDMBS and NoSql, and use them to design systems that can efficiently handle massive amounts of data.\n\nMy expertise lies in developing highly available and performant systems that can handle millions of requests per day, with an emphasis on designing for scale from the outset. I also have a deep understanding of web security and ensure that my systems are designed with robust security measures to protect against vulnerabilities.\n\nFeel free to connect with me to discuss distributed systems, microservices, web security, scalability, or anything related to software development.",
